      "message": "Working with gemini-cli to test this with nanobench\n  \n  Conclusion\n  The promotion of certain DAWN_ASSERT calls to DAWN_CHECK in the local checkout does not have a measurable impact on the performance of the Graphite Dawn Vulkan backend in Skia\u0027s nanobench. The overhead is negligible\n  compared to the natural variance of the benchmarks on this system.",
