      "message": "I agree with the intention but perhaps then can we do it more incrementally; as in in this change can we focus on only ones that will not be expensive and ones that will provide definite value. Aka make a positive but smaller step but a step we are sure we want to make.\n\n(as for the DAWN_CHECK_UNTRIAGED its just that we have quite a bit to do already. I see many TODOs for memory safety issues so I dont want to add more todos for someone to cleanup later)",
